{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>張振朗又有新技能解鎖！在最新一集TVB節目《試真 D 唷》中，張振朗在台北街頭突然化身雜耍人，大玩「拋波」絕技，動作流暢到嚇窒全場！主持江美儀及曾展望（GM）更睇到目瞪口呆，大讚他是「被演戲耽誤的雜耍員」，究竟當時發生了甚麼事？</p><p>張振朗台北街頭突化身雜耍人</p><p>在最新一集節目中，張振朗、江美儀及曾展望（GM）在品嚐完視覺衝擊的「大王具足蟲」拉麵後，轉場到一間創意豆腐花店。當振朗代表大家用扭蛋機決定要食哪款獨特口味時，他竟突然技癢，即場化身雜耍人，大顯身手玩「拋波」。只見他動作極度流暢，完全不像新手，將現場氣氛推至最高潮，展現出鮮為人知的一面。</p><p>江美儀曾展望睇到O嘴 激讚張振朗：好犀利</p><p>面對張振朗突如其來的表演，身旁的江美儀及GM都睇到目瞪口呆，完全被其流暢的動作所震懾。兩人隨即連環大讚：「好犀利」、「好叻」，更封張振朗為「被演戲耽誤的雜耍員」，對他隱藏的技能表示驚訝。除了展現雜耍才藝，三位主持亦在店內挑戰了「威士忌豆腐花」、「麻辣豆腐花」及「堅果叻沙豆腐花」等創新口味，帶來連串味覺衝擊。</p><p>網民洗版大讚多才多藝 求開班授徒</p><p>節目播出後，網民對張振朗的雜耍技能感到非常驚喜，紛紛洗版留言大讚。有網民表示：「估唔到張振朗除咗演戲，仲識雜耍！真係多才多藝！」、「個拋波動作好順喎，肯定練咗好耐，好專業！」不少人更認同節目中的稱號：「『被演戲耽誤的雜耍員』，呢個稱號好貼切，笑死！」更有粉絲開玩笑要求他開班教學：「求開班授徒！想學拋波！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_17682094346ad2ec1f2ce75.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_20737243596ad2ec232bf97.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_891688036ad2ec26c6f05.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_12824314476ad2ec29bdcb1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_7027750676ad2ec2dc8a41.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_15795925626ad2ec316bb49.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_21251014876ad2ec352b0b3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_11648301626ad2ec38ca331.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_20275602826ad2ec3c1aca0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_16282368766ad2ec3f418b5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_8611931826ad2ec42d792e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_3158681876ad2ec486daf7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_8714748726ad2ec4c631c8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_14371122836ad2ec4fc1533.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_9178461046ad2ec533d1e9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_12272611626ad2ec5778621.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T13:18:44.433423+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":865,"images":16,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T12:50:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T15:37:39.013800+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T13:17:35.450510+00:00","content_hash":"ebdf5b01bd03ca231cf76a8be37e44e997d276bfc671ac20d91d95c6ad5753f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}